# Creator Hive — Cursor Rules

## Working directory
/Users/ajil/creator-hive-next

## Before committing
Always run: bash scripts/verify.sh (tsc + build must pass)

## Critical rules

1. SessionProvider must be outermost in src/app/layout.tsx — wraps PostHogProvider.
   Breaking this causes build crash: "Cannot destructure property 'data' of useSession".

2. After prisma/schema.prisma changes: run `npx prisma generate` locally.

3. Never force-push main.

4. All useSession hooks must be in components rendered inside <Providers> 
   (src/components/Providers.tsx contains SessionProvider).

5. Hive routes (/dashboard/hive/*) are public — no auth gate.
   All other /dashboard/* routes require auth via src/app/dashboard/layout.tsx.

## Stack
Next.js 15, TypeScript, React 19, Tailwind v4, Prisma, Supabase, NextAuth v5, 
Stripe Connect, PostHog, Grok (xAI), pnpm

